When the user asks to set up DAIWL, index their knowledge, analyze AI-generated code against their canon,
mark concepts as learned, or record an experience that challenges the AI (in English or Portuguese),
follow `.bks-daiwl/SKILL.md` and `.bks-daiwl/references/`. Answer in the user's language.
